WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:16.836
and Mandy were put into the other carriage, under guard.

2
00:00:18.057 --> 00:00:21.400
The guard was too frightened to hold the glowing photo.

3
00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:23.782
He gave it back to Vinnie.

4
00:00:23.802 --> 00:00:28.545
"Witches," the guard said under his breath.

5
00:00:28.565 --> 00:00:30.327
"We're not!"

6
00:00:30.907 --> 00:00:31.608
cried Vinnie.

7
00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:37.404
As they rode, Vinnie told Mandy all about Edward and the tailor shop.

8
00:00:37.424 --> 00:00:42.527
"I didn't even get to say good-bye," Vinnie said sadly.

9
00:00:43.588 --> 00:00:45.750
Mandy told him about Lady Katherine.

10
00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.512
"She was nice to me," she said.

11
00:00:48.532 --> 00:00:52.034
"But she wanted me to be her servant.

12
00:00:52.675 --> 00:00:53.815
I didn't like that."

13
00:00:54.916 --> 00:00:57.198
Mandy looked through the carriage window.

14
00:00:58.078 --> 00:00:59.860
They were crossing a long bridge.

15
00:01:01.268 --> 00:01:05.210
She could see a stone building with many towers in the distance.

16
00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:07.531
"What's that?"

17
00:01:08.111 --> 00:01:09.551
Vinnie asked, pointing.

18
00:01:09.571 --> 00:01:13.893
"The whole area is called the Tower of London," said the guard.

19
00:01:13.913 --> 00:01:16.734
"The queen lives in the White Tower.

20
00:01:17.094 --> 00:01:18.655
But you're going to the Bell Tower."

21
00:01:19.775 --> 00:01:20.636
"What's in there?"

22
00:01:21.216 --> 00:01:21.876
asked Vinnie.

23
00:01:21.896 --> 00:01:25.018
"It's a prison," replied the guard.

24
00:01:25.038 --> 00:01:27.659
"The queen will decide what to do with you later."

25
00:01:28.859 --> 00:01:30.920
Vinnie and Mandy looked at each other.

26
00:01:31.876 --> 00:01:34.137
"Prison?" Vinnie whispered.

27
00:01:34.157 --> 00:01:36.058
"We're going to prison?"

28
00:01:36.078 --> 00:01:39.439
"Why?" asked Mandy.

29
00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:41.820
The carriage stopped.

30
00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:44.681
The guard pulled the children from the carriage.

31
00:01:45.842 --> 00:01:48.503
Queen Elizabeth's carriage pulled up slowly.

32
00:01:49.544 --> 00:01:52.645
The queen got out and walked over to the children.

33
00:01:52.665 --> 00:01:57.807
"I am not a cruel woman," she said to them.

34
00:01:57.827 --> 00:02:03.203
"However, I will not permit witchcraft in my kingdom."

35
00:02:03.223 --> 00:02:07.366
"But we're not witches," began Vinnie.

36
00:02:08.407 --> 00:02:10.409
"Silence!" cried the Queen.

37
00:02:11.429 --> 00:02:14.412
Then she asked, "Where are your parents?

38
00:02:15.092 --> 00:02:16.394
Are they witches too?"

39
00:02:17.835 --> 00:02:20.037
Vinnie and Mandy did not answer.

40
00:02:20.057 --> 00:02:23.579
"Witchcraft is against the law in England.

41
00:02:24.981 --> 00:02:30.553
I have no choice but to send you to the Bell Tower," Queen Elizabeth said.

42
00:02:31.814 --> 00:02:33.515
Two guards grabbed the children.

43
00:02:33.535 --> 00:02:36.277
"Let go of me!"

44
00:02:36.917 --> 00:02:37.678
Vinnie yelled.

45
00:02:39.939 --> 00:02:43.322
Suddenly, the birds in the trees flew into the sky.

46
00:02:43.342 --> 00:02:45.743
"Vinnie! Look!"

47
00:02:46.444 --> 00:02:48.926
Mandy pointed to the large black birds.

48
00:02:48.946 --> 00:02:52.448
"The photo had black birds in it!"

49
00:02:54.049 --> 00:02:55.590
Vinnie took the photo out.

50
00:02:56.051 --> 00:02:57.732
The picture was glowing blue.

51
00:02:59.104 --> 00:03:03.086
"The tower ravens have been here for many years," said one guard.

52
00:03:03.106 --> 00:03:05.066
"You will get used to them!"

53
00:03:07.287 --> 00:03:13.270
Right after that, a group of men in black hats and red uniforms marched up to Vinnie and

54
00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:16.551
Mandy. They carried long spears.

55
00:03:16.571 --> 00:03:19.672
"Take these children to the tower!"

56
00:03:20.252 --> 00:03:21.173
shouted the queen.

57
00:03:21.193 --> 00:03:23.654
"Look, Mandy!"

58
00:03:24.234 --> 00:03:24.954
cried Vinnie.

59
00:03:24.974 --> 00:03:26.775
"That's it!"

60
00:03:27.355 --> 00:03:28.756
Mandy said excitedly.

61
00:03:29.708 --> 00:03:32.530
"The ravens and the spears are in the photo!"

62
00:03:35.151 --> 00:03:38.493
Vinnie noticed the spears in the photo were glowing red.

63
00:03:39.694 --> 00:03:44.317
The children closed their eyes and fell into the deep dark tunnel.

64
00:03:48.079 --> 00:03:52.422
Back in the attic, Vinnie and Mandy let out a sigh of relief.

65
00:03:53.603 --> 00:03:55.424
It was good to be home.
